        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87750369?u=ccc1f52005708ae16bcb50e325e02145bff0ef7d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The PR does following changes:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Uses livesample macro instead of GHLivesample macro by embedding the code in the content file</li>\n<li>Adds more color spaces in the output color table</li>\n<li>Adds text color input field. This will help users convert their custom color  in various formats and color spaces.</li>\n<li>Also, makes small tweeks to the other color mixer tool.</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The new look of the tool:<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/87750369/490041585-7afdb20c-f58f-48b2-a45c-d4d756d66bc5.jpg?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..LYK77_lWdyQE5PGi84DRQWH2FDrFJLyfvUJgYbCJnj0\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/87750369/490041585-7afdb20c-f58f-48b2-a45c-d4d756d66bc5.jpg?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..LYK77_lWdyQE5PGi84DRQWH2FDrFJLyfvUJgYbCJnj0\" alt=\"1\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>",
